avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-08-06T10:56:08Z","label":{"name":"loader options","color":"b3f29b"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/3159874699","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/12790#issuecomment-3159874699","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/12790","id":3159874699,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX5JB868V9yL","user":{"login":"quantuminternet","id":49562501,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTYyNTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49562501?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet","html_url":"https://github.com/quantuminternet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T12:00:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T12:00:27Z","body":"Hi,\n\nfrom what I understand from the code (and it is hinted in the documentation), selectinload and selectin_polymorphic are similar, but have different implementations. The former has chunking implemented, the latter not.\n\nThe loading from the employee table by company_id will be chunked in batches of 500 when I add more than 500 or more companies. But then the loading from the manager/engineer table by employee_id will not have any chunking.\n\nE.g. with 1000 companies with 2 managers and one engineer each:\n```\nSELECT employee.company_id AS employee_company_id, employee.id AS employee_id, employee.name AS employee_name, employee.type AS employee_type \nFROM employee \nWHERE employee.company_id IN ([1-500])\nSELECT employee.company_id AS employee_company_id, employee.id AS employee_id, employee.name AS employee_name, employee.type AS employee_type \nFROM employee \nWHERE employee.company_id IN ([501-1000])\nSELECT manager.id AS manager_id, employee.id AS employee_id, employee.type AS employee_type, manager.manager_name AS manager_manager_name \nFROM employee JOIN manager ON employee.id = manager.id \nWHERE employee.id IN ([1-2000])\nSELECT engineer.id AS engineer_id, employee.id AS employee_id, employee.type AS employee_type, engineer.engineer_info AS engineer_engineer_info \nFROM employee JOIN engineer ON employee.id = engineer.id \nWHERE employee.id IN ([2001-3000])\n```\nThe first two queries would be fine (and if I added more companies, it would add more queries), but the third one would crash on Oracle. And the fourth query would also crash on Oracle if one more engineer was added to any company","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/3159874699/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"quantuminternet","id":49562501,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTYyNTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49562501?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet","html_url":"https://github.com/quantuminternet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quantuminternet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/3160120490","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/12790#issuecomment-3160120490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/12790","id":3160120490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX5JB868W5yq","user":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","fol